---
import List from "#/components/ui/List.astro";
import Paragraph from "#/components/ui/Paragraph.astro";
import Section from "#/components/ui/Section.astro";
import Heading from "#/components/ui/Heading.astro";
import IconText from "#/components/ui/IconText.astro";
---

<Section variant="light">
    <div slot="text" class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-333 flex-col gap-3 xl:flex-row">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            <Heading>
                But what about <em class="text-bubblegum-pink not-italic">privacy?</em>
            </Heading>
            <Paragraph>
                Texts are stripped out of all information except for their content (which is the only thing that this
                bot needs for making memes). This means that usernames and other identifying information is not stored.
                Saved messages are not used for training of AI models or any other purpose rather than to keep the bot
                functional.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                For GIFs and Images we store their link sources, actual files themselves are never saved to <b
                    >Jstmemit</b
                > servers.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                By default the bot is turned off in every channel and will only work in the one where you enable it
                using
                <b> /enable</b>.
            </Paragraph>
            <Paragraph>
                Saved data is automatically deleted after a period of time, however you can always delete yours at any
                moment if you wish to do so using the <b> /settings</b> command
            </Paragraph>

            <List>
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/gif.svg"
                    alt="gif logo icon"
                    text="GIFs: 90 days"
                />
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/chats.svg"
                    alt="texts icon"
                    text="Texts: 30 days"
                />
                <IconText
                    icon="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/emojis/image.svg"
                    alt="image icon"
                    text="Images: 1 day"
                />
            </List>
        </div>

        <div>
            <ul class="relative flex flex-col gap-10">
                <li class="bg-carbon-black absolute min-h-auto min-w-90 rounded-2xl p-4 pt-5 pl-0">
                    <span class="bg-bubblegum-pink absolute -top-5 -left-5 rounded-xl p-1 px-2 text-lg font-extrabold"
                        >Discord</span
                    >
                    <img
                        class="w-90"
                        src="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/cocaColaBetterThanPepsi.png"
                        alt="A discord message saying that cola is better than pepsi, has an avatar, username, tag"
                    />
                </li>
                <li class="absolute top-40 left-25 z-10 min-h-auto min-w-50">
                    <img src="https://files.wideunits.nl/jstmemit/images/arrowBent.svg" alt="pink arrow" />
                </li>
                <li class="bg-carbon-black absolute top-45 left-60 rounded-2xl p-6">
                    <span class="bg-bubblegum-pink absolute -top-5 -left-5 rounded-xl p-1 px-2 text-lg font-extrabold"
                        >Stored</span
                    >
                    <pre
                        class="font-mono text-sm">
<span class="text-golden">{`{`}</span>
    <span class="text-hot-fuchsia">[</span>
        <span class="text-dark-cyan">"<span class="text-white">Coca cola is better than pepsi</span>"</span>,
        <span class="text-dark-cyan">"<span class="text-white">and fanta</span>"</span>
    <span class="text-hot-fuchsia">]</span>
<span class="text-golden">{`}`}</span></pre>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</Section>
